---
import { GROUP_ORDER, GROUP_META, topicsByGroup } from "../data/topics";
---

<div class="topic-links" id="guides">
  <h2 class="topic-links-heading">
    <span class="copy-ko">갓바위 주제별 안내</span>
    <span class="copy-en">Gatbawi guides by topic</span>
  </h2>
  <p class="topic-links-intro">
    <span class="copy-ko"
      >대구 측과 경산 측을 구분하고, 접근·동선·날씨·방문 예절을 주제별로 정리했습니다.</span
    >
    <span class="copy-en"
      >Separate Daegu and Gyeongsan approaches, with access, routes, weather, and
      respectful visiting advice organised by topic.</span
    >
  </p>

  {
    GROUP_ORDER.map((gid) => {
      const meta = GROUP_META[gid];
      const topics = topicsByGroup(gid);
      return (
        <section class="topic-links-group">
          <h3>
            <span class="copy-ko">{meta.titleKo}</span>
            <span class="copy-en">{meta.titleEn}</span>
          </h3>
          <ul class="topic-links-list">
            {topics.map((t) => (
              <li>
                <a href={`/${t.slug}/`}>
                  <span class="copy-ko">{t.ko.h1}</span>
                  <span class="copy-en">{t.en.h1}</span>
                </a>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </section>
      );
    })
  }
</div>
